Each matching descriptor entry certifies only the layout
property it measures. Keep separate tests for C argument and
result classification, scalar widths and signedness, and
ownership or lifetime policy. Bit fields and flexible array
members do not fit this simple fixed-field probe. In a
cross-compile, obtain measurements from the target toolchain
or run the probe on the target; a host layout match is not
evidence about the compiled library.
